            "definition": "CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.current_user_role()\n RETURNS text\n LANGUAGE sql\n STABLE SECURITY DEFINER\n SET search_path TO 'public'\nAS $function$\r\n  SELECT role FROM public.profiles WHERE id = auth.uid();\r\n$function$\n",
