            "definition": "CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.get_my_profile_context()\n RETURNS TABLE(user_role text, linked_teacher_id uuid, linked_student_id uuid)\n LANGUAGE sql\n STABLE SECURITY DEFINER\n SET search_path TO 'public'\nAS $function$\r\n  SELECT p.role::text, p.teacher_id, p.student_id\r\n  FROM public.profiles p\r\n  WHERE p.id = auth.uid()\r\n  LIMIT 1;\r\n$function$\n",
